  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\n**(First number - 1)² + (First number - 1) = Second number.**\n\n \n• 13: 156 → (13 - 1)² + (13 - 1) = 12² + 12 = 144 + 12 = 156\n \n• **18: ? → (18 - 1)² + (18 - 1) = 17² + 17 = 289 + 17 = 306**\n \n• 17 : 272 → (17 - 1)² + (17 - 1) = 16² + 16 = 256 + 16 = 272\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"306\".**",
